{"ID":"20240521155611-kkupumk","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240521155611-kkupumk","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240521155611-kkupumk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240521155611-egm9633\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240521160942-682vkgf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:500\u0026#125;","title":"美國癌症中心的論文","type":"doc","updated":"20240521160942"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240521155611-egm9633","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155611-egm9633","updated":"20240521160649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"This is all great advice for healthy living, but it was not published by Johns Hopkins."}]},{"ID":"20240521160649-ayl1a7l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160649-ayl1a7l","updated":"20240521160651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Excellent article on cancer. Pass it on."}]},{"ID":"20240521160652-ymksx5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160652-ymksx5y","updated":"20240521160654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"AFTER YEARS OF TELLING PEOPLE CHEMOTHERAPY IS THE ONLY WAY TO TRY AND ELIMINATE CANCER,  JOHNS HOPKINS IS FINALLY STARTING TO TELL YOU THERE IS AN ALTERNATIVE WAY.     "}]},{"ID":"20240521160654-so8dei1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160654-so8dei1","updated":"20240521160659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Cancer Update from Johns Hopkins :"}]},{"ID":"20240521160659-oib4ryw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160659-oib4ryw","updated":"20240521160710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"1. Every person has cancer cells in the body. These cancer cells do not show up in the standard tests until they have multiplied to a few billion. When doctors tell cancer patients that there are no more cancer cells in their bodies after treatment, it just means the tests are unable to detect the cancer cells because they have not reached the detectable size."}]},{"ID":"20240521160710-319iwxi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160710-319iwxi","updated":"20240521160717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. Cancer cells occur between 6 to more than 10 times in a person's lifetime. "}]},{"ID":"20240521160713-5vu9j4i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160713-5vu9j4i","updated":"20240521160720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. When the person's immune system is strong the cancer cells will be destroyed and prevented from multiplying and forming tumours. "}]},{"ID":"20240521160721-6nmhnaf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160721-6nmhnaf","updated":"20240521160723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. When a person has cancer it indicates the person has multiple nutritional deficiencies. These could be due to genetic, environmental,food and lifestyle factors. "}]},{"ID":"20240521160724-94le84s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160724-94le84s","updated":"20240521160729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.To overcome the multiple nutritional deficiencies, changing diet and including supplements will strengthen the immune system. "}]},{"ID":"20240521160729-c5teg9b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160729-c5teg9b","updated":"20240521160840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"em text","TextMarkTextContent":"(consuming vitamins and other nutritional supplements will feed cancer cells and must be avoided)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521160739-g65rbdg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160739-g65rbdg","updated":"20240521160739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. Chemotherapy involves poisoning the rapidly-growing cancer cells and also destroys rapidly-growing healthy cells in the bone marrow,gastro-intestinal tract etc, and can cause organ damage, like liver, kidneys, heart, lungs etc. "}]},{"ID":"20240521160740-39y3lnv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160740-39y3lnv","updated":"20240521160742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. Radiation while destroying cancer cells also burns, scars and damages healthy cells, tissues and organs. "}]},{"ID":"20240521160742-zkt3ajz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160742-zkt3ajz","updated":"20240521160747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8. Initial treatment with chemotherapy and radiation will often reduce tumour size. However prolonged use of chemotherapy and radiation do notresult in more tumour destruction. "}]},{"ID":"20240521160747-3klkcxw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160747-3klkcxw","updated":"20240521160750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"9. When the body has too much toxic burden from chemotherapy and radiation the immune system is either compromised or destroyed, hencethe person can succumb to various kinds of infections and complications."}]},{"ID":"20240521160750-b94t59j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160750-b94t59j","updated":"20240521160753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10. Chemotherapy and radiation can cause cancer cells to mutate and become resistant and difficult to destroy. Surgery can also cause cancer cells to spread to other sites. "}]},{"ID":"20240521160754-mgoyxj3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160754-mgoyxj3","updated":"20240521160847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"11. An effective way to battle cancer is to starve the cancer cells by not feeding it with the foods it needs to multiply. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"em text","TextMarkTextContent":"(vitamins and other nutritional supplements are highly concentrated acidic nutrition which feeds cancer cells and must be avoided)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521160757-oqjo8ph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160757-oqjo8ph"}},{"ID":"20240521160801-6py5t85","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160801-6py5t85","updated":"20240521160801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"WHAT CANCER CELLS FEED ON: "}]},{"ID":"20240521160802-hwb4th8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160802-hwb4th8","updated":"20240521160806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"a. Sugar is a cancer-feeder. By cutting off sugar it cuts off one important food supply to the cancer cells. Sugar substitutes like NutraSweet, Equal,Spoonful etc are made with Aspartame and it is harmful. A better natural substitute would be Manuka honey or molasses but only in very small amounts. Table salt has a chemical added to make it white in colour. Better alternative is Bragg's aminos or sea salt. "}]},{"ID":"20240521160806-uo55ua0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160806-uo55ua0","updated":"20240521160811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"b. Milk causes the body to produce mucus, especially in the gastro-intestinal tract. Cancer feeds on mucus. By cutting off milk andsubstituting with unsweetened soya milk, cancer cells are being starved. "}]},{"ID":"20240521160812-stc09h0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160812-stc09h0","updated":"20240521160816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"c. Cancer cells thrive in an acid environment. A meat-based diet is acidic and it is best to eat fish, and a little chicken rather than beef or pork. Meat also contains livestock antibiotics, growth hormones and parasites, which are all harmful, especially to people with cancer. "}]},{"ID":"20240521160816-o6rg5oa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160816-o6rg5oa","updated":"20240521160821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"d. A diet made of 80% fresh vegetables and juice, whole grains, seeds, nuts and a little fruits help put the body into an alkalineenvironment.  About 20% can be from cooked food including beans. Fresh vegetable juices provide live enzymes that are easily absorbed and reachdown to cellular levels within 15 minutes to no urish and enhance growth of healthy cells. To obtain live enzymes for building healthy cells tryand drink fresh vegetable juice (most vegetables including bean sprouts) and eat some raw vegetables 2 or 3 times a day. Enzymes are destroyed attemperatures of 104 degrees F (40 degrees C). "}]},{"ID":"20240521160826-zasrqer","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160826-zasrqer","updated":"20240521160826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"e. Avoid coffee, tea, and chocolate, which have high caffeine. Green tea is a better alternative and has cancer-fighting properties.Water- "}]},{"ID":"20240521160826-eseciby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160826-eseciby","updated":"20240521160832"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"   (pure filtered water and natural teas are good for the body they are alkaline in nature)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521160848-almgj4w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160848-almgj4w","updated":"20240521160900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12. Meat protein is difficult to digest and requires a lot of digestive enzymes. Undigested meat remaining in the intestines become putrefiedand leads to more toxic build-up. "}]},{"ID":"20240521160901-sxpk0wz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160901-sxpk0wz","updated":"20240521160906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13. Cancer cell walls have a tough protein covering. By refraining from or eating less meat it frees more enzymes to attack the protein walls ofcancer cells and allows the body's killer cells to destroy the cancer cells. "}]},{"ID":"20240521160906-a75unpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160906-a75unpm","updated":"20240521160914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"14. Some supplements build up the immune system (IP6, Flor-ssence, Essiac, anti-oxidants, vitamins, minerals, EFAs etc.) to enable thebody's own killer cells to destroy cancer cells. Other supplements like vitamin E are known to cause apoptosis, or programmed cell death, the body's normal method of disposing of damaged, unwanted, or unneeded cells."},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"em text","TextMarkTextContent":" (nutrients and vitamins obtained from eating regular foods will help the immune system while the concentrated nutritional supplements and vitamins will feed cancer cells.  )"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521160910-npjmqvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160910-npjmqvr","updated":"20240521160918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"15. Cancer is a disease of the mind, body, and spirit. A proactive and positive spirit will help the cancer warrior be a survivor. Anger,unforgiveness and bitterness put the body into a stressful and acidic environment. Learn to have a loving and forgiving spirit. Learn to relaxand enjoy life. "}]},{"ID":"20240521160918-haqy9a8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160918-haqy9a8","updated":"20240521160921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"16. Cancer cells cannot thrive in an oxygenated environment. Exercising daily, and deep breathing help to get more oxygen down to the cellularlevel. Oxygen therapy is another means employed to destroy cancer cells."}]},{"ID":"20240521160921-guz45fl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160921-guz45fl","updated":"20240521160925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(PLEASE FORWARD IT TO PEOPLE YOU CARE ABOUT) "}]},{"ID":"20240521160925-l6lycc7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160925-l6lycc7","updated":"20240521160928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"This is an article that should be sent to anyone important in your life. "}]},{"ID":"20240521160928-cprpp6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160928-cprpp6i","updated":"20240521160930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"I just did (the added comments in red bold were added to supplement this report courtesy of  Ni's Acupuncture Center.)"}]},{"ID":"20240521160936-y1iko5f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160936-y1iko5f"}},{"ID":"20240521160931-hdumixq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160931-hdumixq","updated":"20240521160937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"讀者看完這篇論文後，是否覺得跟我說的非常類似呢? 不要再被西藥廠欺騙了，不要再胡鬧了，應該學會如何好好過日子了，祝大家身體健康，好好享受人生才對。相信西醫學，你所付出的代價就是提早又非常痛苦的死翹翹，醒醒吧，不要繼續再胡鬧下去了。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521160937-d9e6igk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160937-d9e6igk","updated":"20240521160941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"這篇論文其中有關於營養劑的研究部分是錯誤的，需要做些修正。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521160942-682vkgf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521160942-682vkgf"}}]}